Description: SDIO on the Raspberry Pi 4 and 5
 The build list entries and the static personality for the SDIO bus layer
 and the Raspberry Pi's SDIO host, whose drivers are in xnu-overlay/. The
 host's personality probes first, and takes only a non-removable slot
 with a WiFi chip in the device tree.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-20
